  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan forced. Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks. Roughly chop capsicum. Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857488787dab3cf70b8c0a/step-4ba2e5eb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, finely chop garlic. Thinly slice brown onion. Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857488787dab3cf70b8c0a/step-f1f279a1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add onion and cook, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic and garlic & herb seasoning and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857488787dab3cf70b8c0a/step-0ed9630e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan, add chickpeas, diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, water, honey and vegetable stock pot. Bring to a boil, then simmer for 3-4 minutes, or until slightly thickened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857488787dab3cf70b8c0a/step-2783226a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the soup is simmering, roughly chop kalamata olives.\n• To the soup, add roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves. Gently stir to combine until wilted, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857488787dab3cf70b8c0a/step-047855f7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the Mediterranean vegetable & chickpea stew between bowls.\n• Top with a dollop of basil pesto, olives and crumble over the fetta cheese to serve. Enjoy! TIP: Add less olives if you're not a fan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857488787dab3cf70b8c0a/step-e08b8032.jpg"
    }
  ]
